<title>BELGIUM: ERM meeting seen lasting until evening.</title>
<headline>ERM meeting seen lasting until evening.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union monetary committee meeting on the lira's re-entry into the exchange rate mechanism (ERM) is expected to last until late evening at the earliest, an EU monetary official said on Saturday.</p>
<p>&quot;I hope the meeting will end by late evening,&quot; the official said as he entered the building where the discussions are to take place.</p>
<p>He said the meeting was still scheduled to begin at one p.m. local time (1200 GMT) but that some delegations may be late in arriving.</p>
<p>Italy called the meeting on Friday, asking to return the lira to the ERM after a four-year absence.</p>
</text>
